{#- The week's lunch specials and soups, one row per day.

    THE PALETTE. The body is cream, not the teal ground of the other posts,
    because this one carries the accent red: red on teal is 1.3:1 and the
    palette forbids it, red on cream is 5.08:1. Teal bands top and bottom
    keep it recognisably the same account as the profile picture, and a
    light body sits better beside real food photos when the post carries
    several images.

    WHAT IS SAID ONCE, AT THE TOP. The drink is part of every plate
    (specials.includesDrink) and the soup is sold separately at one Cup /
    Bowl price (from menu.json), so both are said once, as two tags above
    the table, rather than on every row (client 2026-10-09: soup prices at
    the top, like the drink).

    THE SOUP SITS IN ITS DAY'S ROW, in its own right-hand cell under a
    "Soup" label, so a day reads across: plate, then soup. Until 2026-10-09
    the soups had a box of their own under the table; that box now lists
    the choice of side instead.

    THE SIDES are the Deli Salads row's `choices` in menu.json, listed
    once under the week, every week: they are what "with choice of side"
    (anySide) means, and they can be swapped in for the set sides on any
    other special (client 2026-10-09), so the box says both.

    Every size is set for the ~540px a portrait post shows at on a phone:
    nothing a customer needs is under 24px. -#}
{%- set week = specials.days | latestWeek %}
{%- set soupCat = (menu.categories | where("id", "soup"))[0] %}
{%- set sidesCat = (menu.categories | where("id", "sides"))[0] %}
{%- set deli = (sidesCat.items | selectattr("choices") | first) if sidesCat else null %}
{%- set first = week[0].date | dayDate("monthDay") %}
{%- set last = week[week.length - 1].date | dayDate("monthDay") %}
{#- "October 5 – 9", or "September 28 – October 2" across a month end. -#}
{%- if first.split(" ")[0] == last.split(" ")[0] %}
{%- set range = first + " – " + last.split(" ")[1] %}
{%- else %}
{%- set range = first + " – " + last %}
{%- endif %}
<div class="canvas wk">

    <header class="wk-head">
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero wk-wordmark">
            {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
        </div>
        <p class="p-display-italic wk-kicker">This Week&rsquo;s Lunch Specials</p>
        <p class="p-label wk-range">{{ range }}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="wk-body">
        <p class="p-label wk-served">Starting at 11am</p>
        <div class="wk-tags">
            {%- if specials.includesDrink %}
            <p class="wk-tag wk-tag--drink">Every special includes a drink</p>
            {%- endif %}
            {%- if soupCat and soupCat.items %}
            <p class="wk-tag wk-tag--soup">Soup {% for s in soupCat.items %}{% if not loop.first %} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {% endif %}{{ s.name }} {{ s.price | money }}{% endfor %}</p>
            {%- endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="wk-table">
            {%- for d in week %}
            {%- set sides = d | specialSides(true) %}
            <div class="wk-row">
                <p class="p-display wk-dayname">{{ d.date | dayDate("short") }}</p>
                <div class="wk-special-cell">
                    <p class="p-display wk-special">{{ d.special }}</p>
                    {%- if sides %}
                    <p class="p-body wk-sides">{{ sides }}</p>
                    {%- endif %}
                </div>
                {%- if d.soup %}
                <div class="wk-soup-cell">
                    <p class="p-label wk-soup-label">Soup</p>
                    <p class="wk-soup-name">{{ d.soup }}</p>
                </div>
                {%- endif %}
            </div>
            {%- endfor %}
        </div>

        {%- if deli %}
        <section class="wk-choice">
            <p class="p-display wk-choice-title">Sides</p>
            <p class="p-body wk-choice-note">Pick one on a &ldquo;choice of side&rdquo; day, or swap them for the sides on any special</p>
            <ul class="wk-choices">
                {%- for c in deli.choices %}
                <li>{{ c }}</li>
                {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}
    </div>

    <footer class="wk-foot">
        <p class="p-display wk-foot-call">{{ site.phone }} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {{ site.social.website }}</p>
        <p class="p-body wk-foot-line">{{ site.opening.hoursDays }}, {{ site.opening.opens.time }}{{ site.opening.opens.meridiem }} &ndash; {{ site.opening.closes.time }}{{ site.opening.closes.meridiem }} &middot; {{ site.address.street }}</p>
    </footer>

</div>
